### Auth requests
# REST Client file for auth endpoints.

### Auth - Sign in
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Auth - Validate email token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/validate-email/validationToken123
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Auth - Resend validation token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-validation-token/user@example.com
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Auth - Send reset password token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-reset-password-token/user@example.com
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Auth - Reset password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password/resetToken123
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "password": "newPassword123"
}
